E("Hyaena hyaena", "species", "land", "hyena", 2, 0, ["af-n", "af-e", "ar", "as-w", "in", "as-c"], "The striped hyena, a solitary scavenger of dry country from the Sahel to India.", [D, G], cls=(M, "Carnivora", "Hyaenidae"))
