E("Equus hemionus", "species", "land", "horse", 2, 0, ["as-c", "as-w", "in", "ar"], "The onager or kulan, the wild ass of the Asian deserts, able to run at 70 km/h.", [D, G], cls=(M, "Perissodactyla", "Equidae"))
